		{
			"id":"a628deaca8fa66d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Deep Reinforcement Learning‑Driven Intelligent Portfolio Management with Green Computing\n\nThis paper proposes **DPDRL**, a reinforcement learning portfolio management system that dynamically selects among multiple prediction models and adjusts portfolio allocation based on market environment analysis to improve risk-adjusted returns.\n\n## Method 1:\nSingle DRL agent with following algorithms tested:\n\n- DQN\n    \n- PPO\n    \n- A2C\n    \n- DDPG\n\n## Method 2:\nIndependent DRL agents per asset\n\n## Method 3:\nAdaptive framework - system chooses best performing agent dynamically",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2520,
			"y":-400,
			"width":1180,
			"height":780
		},
		{
			"id":"c9ef5e89d78d7d24",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"$log(\\frac{portfolio_{after}}{portfolio_{before}})$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
