		},
		{
			"id":"7ff517734cb89169",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Reward Function  \n# $R_t = αRport_t − βDDt − λσ_t − δI(W_t < Wcrit)$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":4182,
			"width":600,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"ec8da1dcdfb0a3a0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Training Engine\n• PPO optimization\n• Advantage estimation\n• Batch updates",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1620,
			"y":2223,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"48aab47004de2673",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Portfolio Allocation (using softmax layer)\n# $[weq_{t+1}, wbond_{t+1}, wcash_{t+1}]$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1660,
			"y":2990,
			"width":480,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"362115ad2fa8de05",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Poliicy Network",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1520,
			"y":2560,
			"width":390,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"2329ceea240fac69",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Value Network",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1980,
			"y":2560,
			"width":320,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"ceccb1c564217c29",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Market Dynamics\n\nMarket Return Generator  \n$r_t = [req_t, rbond_t, rcash_t]$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1490,
			"y":3520,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"8f3f779221255f15",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Income Model\n\nIncome Dynamics  \n$I_t$ = 0 with probability $p_{job}$  \n$I_t = I_{t−1} (1 + g)$ otherwise",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1770,
			"y":3520,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"13bbce9c66b9dff3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Wealth Update\n\n$W_{t+1} = W_t(1 + Rport_t) + I_t − C_t − X_t$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1740,
			"y":3825,
			"width":320,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"b11d4ed53835f0d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Reward",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1260,
			"y":3210,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"33967ce13b2245d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Portfolio Statistics  \n(return, volatility, drawdown)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1730,
			"y":4024,
			"width":340,
			"height":102
		},
		{
			"id":"558e1b4090e9ae9d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Portfolio Return\n# $Rport_t = wt^ᵀ r_t$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":3190,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"01078c80f299acd4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Transaction cost model\n# $C_t = κ Σ|wi_{t+1} − wi,t|$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1910,
			"y":3190,
			"width":330,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"61c7714716c85418",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Expense Model\n\nExpense Model  \n$X_t = Xbase + Xshock_t$\n(Log normal shock distribution)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2050,
			"y":3520,
			"width":260,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"861590ec82b08fa9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Market Data:\n• Equity index returns  \n• Bond returns  \n• Risk-free rate  \n• Market volatility  \n• Market drawdown  \n• Regime indicators",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":2173,
			"width":400,
			"height":235
		},
		{
			"id":"ed15d76585c22614",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Personal Financial Profile  \n• Initial wealth  \n• Income level  \n• Income volatility  \n• Job loss probability  \n• Monthly expenses  \n• Emergency fund  \n• Age  \n• Financial goal horizon",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":2445,
			"width":400,
			"height":290
		},
		{
			"id":"f751bce42118fcee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Evaluation layer\n\nBenchmark Strategies\n\n- 60/40 portfolio  \n- Age glide path  \n- Risk parity  \n- Volatility targeting  \n- CPPI\n\n#### Metrics \n\n- Return  \n- Sharpe ratio  \n- Max drawdown  \n- Probability of ruin  \n- Liquidity shortfall  \n- Recovery time",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-20,
			"y":3020,
			"width":360,
			"height":540,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"45be5941aeb61505",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Wealth + ALlocations",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":430,
			"y":2705,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4ec5e251b404504a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Environment executes portfolio",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1850,
			"y":1700,
			"width":280,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"51c2c8ea54abe2eb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Portfolio weights (conditioned to sum of weights as 1) - using softmax",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2130,
			"y":1481,
			"width":260,
			"height":85,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"dbfce789707131b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## FC layer\n\ndecides the final portfolio weights based on the learned weights for each of the agents",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":900,
			"y":1238,
			"width":260,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"50ea2f4c22eb5a52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Reward 3 - Maximum drawdown (Goal is to avoid large losses)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":120,
			"y":1218,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"75a5caffcbf3141b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Method 1:\nPolicy network \nSingle DRL agent trained separately  \n(DQN / PPO / A2C / DDPG)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1340,
			"y":1062,
			"width":308,
			"height":246
		},
		{
			"id":"bcb34084466b4b2b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Environment executes portfolio",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":580,
			"y":1146,
			"width":280,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"501d74ce08480712",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Reward 2 - Differential Sharpe ratio (Goal is to maximize return relative to volatility)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":120,
			"y":1076,
			"width":260,
			"height":110,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"0a1e7580b39a9627",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Environment executes portfolio",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2620,
			"y":1409,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"de763d0ac6eb9ab5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Portfolio Allocation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2950,
			"y":1409,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"549e091dd91e30c6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### State Vector\n- Portfolio state\n- Market features\n- Household financial variables\n\n# $s_t =[W_t, weq_t, wbond_t, wcash_t,  V_t, D_t, M_t,  I_t, σ_I, p_{job},   E_t, age, goal_t]$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":555,
			"y":2223,
			"width":790,
			"height":275
		},
		{
			"id":"f76828f7f0b5807d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Risk-aware reward function\n\n$r_t​=log(1+R_t​)+α⋅CalmarRatio−β⋅σ_t$\n\nlog return encourages portfolio growth\ncalmar ratio measures return/drawdown which encourages strategies with lower drawdowns\nvolatility penalties for high volatility\n\n$\\gamma = 0.99$ (long-term rewards prioritized)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1340,
			"y":1549,
			"width":380,
			"height":258,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"aa9f271141cef35c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Next State",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1760,
			"y":1463,
			"width":140,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"b87a9d5c261f3e83",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Reward + Next state",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1360,
			"y":1433,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"667899e3f7cb29e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Method 2:\nPolicy network \nIndependent DRL agent for each asset  \nAgent1 → asset1  \nAgent2 → asset2  \nAgent3 → asset3  .. and so on",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1669,
			"y":1062,
			"width":306,
			"height":246
		},
		{
			"id":"8e9a7ac43d08a9d7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Method 3:\nPolicy network\n- Multiple DRL agents  \n(DQN, PPO, A2C, DDPG)  \n- Performance monitor  \n(rolling 5-day PnL)  \n- Adaptive agent selector",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2000,
			"y":1062,
			"width":390,
			"height":246
		}
	],
